{"id":"tratado","lemma":"tratado","pos":"noun","rank":1565,"glosses":["treaty"],"ipa":"/tɾaˈtado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tratados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tratado.wav","examples":[{"text":"El tratado fue firmado.","en":"The treaty was signed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461486"},{"text":"Fueron tratados de hipotermia.","en":"They were treated for hypothermia.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061936"},{"text":"España aprobó el tratado.","en":"Spain approved the treaty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639544"},{"text":"Los animales son tratados bien.","en":"The animals are treated well."},{"text":"Nadie merece ser tratado así.","en":"No one deserves to be treated like that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152253"}]}